# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rig-local configuration.
# Every rig has its own geometry, calibration and paths. These files must
# NEVER be committed: a rig checking out another rig's values would get a
# silently wrong degree-to-pixel mapping, not a crash.
# See ScreenParams.example.ini / FilePaths.example.ini for the documented keys.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main code/inis/ScreenParams.ini
Main code/inis/FilePaths.ini
*.bak_*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Never commit private keys.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rig1gandhi*
*.pem
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MATLAB editor autosaves
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.asv
*.m~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime scratch. Recreated by MHost2.startupFcn / LiveParams on every launch.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main code/.Parameters_Internal/
Main code/.Tasks_Internal/
Main code/.Custom_Functions/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-rig, high churn
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main code/ErrorLogs/
Main code/data/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MATLAB Compiler output and project files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main code/MHost2/
Main code/RewardHandler/RewardHandler/
Main code/Utilities/SoundGenerator/
*.prj

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# App Designer exports. MHost2.m would SHADOW MHost2.mlapp - MATLAB resolves
# the .m first, so the app would never launch. MHost2_exported.m is the safe
# tracked export: App Designer renames the class precisely to avoid this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main code/MHost2.m
Main code/MHost2_debug.txt
Main code/inis/classdef SoundGenerator  matlab.txt
Main code/inputtest.m
